  "title": "Tom Ka Gai (Coconut Chicken Soup)",
  "description": "Coconut milk and lime juice seasoned with ginger root and cayenne pepper create a spicy broth for this Thai-inspired soup with strips of white chicken, cilantro and chopped scallions.",
